== Notes ==
*This spell protects against [[sonic damage]] as well as elemental damage.
*This spell stacks with &mdash; and is applied after &mdash; [[feat]]-based sources of damage resistance.
* This spell will replace earlier castings of itself.
*The standard [[scroll]] for this spell was added in the [[expansion pack]]s. Thus, scrolls of ''energy buffer'' cannot be obtained in the [[original campaign]]. (Custom scrolls are still a possibility in other [[module]]s that do not require the expansions, though.)
*Unlike the other elemental resistance spells, this one can only target the caster.

